{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-199767-r4509836","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Molasses-Glazed Pork Chops","sourcePageId":199767,"sourceRevision":"4509836","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-16T01:07:11Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Molasses-Glazed%20Pork%20Chops&oldid=4509836","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T13:09:19.205Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Grilled recipes","Category:Main course recipes","Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes using cayenne","Category:Recipes using ground ginger","Category:Recipes using lime juice","Category:Recipes using molasses","Category:Recipes using pork chop","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"5b0c91184c1a40e3b438b293aee1ed36eabc3fff2135d771d60da5ecd3533472","sourceWikitext":"{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Pork recipes\n| Difficulty = 3\n}}\n\n{{recipe}}\n\n== Ingredients ==\n* 4 thick-cut [[Cookbook:Pork|pork]] rib chops\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* 1 tsp [[Cookbook:Black Pepper|black pepper]]\n* 2 tsp dried [[Cookbook:Rosemary|rosemary]]\n* ½ tsp ground [[Cookbook:Ginger|ginger]]\n* 6 [[Cookbook:Ounce|oz]] [[Cookbook:Molasses|molasses]]\n* 1 tsp [[Cookbook:Garlic Powder|garlic powder]]\n* ¾ tsp [[Cookbook:Cayenne Pepper|cayenne pepper]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Cider Vinegar|cider vinegar]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Lime|limes]], juiced\n\n== Procedure ==\n#Place pork chops in a large zip-top bag. Combine liquid ingredients and pour into bag. [[Cookbook:Marinating|Marinate]] in the fridge for at least 30 minutes.\n#Take pork out of marinade. Combine dry seasonings and rub on pork. Heat your [[Cookbook:Grill|grill]] as high as it will go.\n#[[Cookbook:Boiling|Boil]] marinade for 10 minutes.\n#Place pork on grill and cook 2 minutes, [[Cookbook:Brush|brushing]] with marinade, before rotating 90 degrees to get nice grill marks. Cook another 2 minutes, brushing.\n#Flip to the other side and repeat. Remove from grill and let rest for 10 minutes. Serve with additional marinade.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using pork chop]]\n[[Category:Recipes using molasses]]\n[[Category:Grilled recipes]]\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lime juice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cayenne]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ground ginger]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Molasses-Glazed Pork Chops","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"4 thick-cut pork rib chops","sourceText":"4 thick-cut pork rib chops","amountText":"4 thick-cut pork rib chops","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 tsp salt","sourceText":"1 tsp salt","amountText":"1 tsp salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1 tsp black pepper","sourceText":"1 tsp black pepper","amountText":"1 tsp black pepper","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"2 tsp dried rosemary","sourceText":"2 tsp dried rosemary","amountText":"2 tsp dried rosemary","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"½ tsp ground g